            "review_title": "Review at Grounded Chay - 75 Nhị Hà",
            "review_text": "Alaa O\n1 contribution\n1\nLittle gem of Vietnam!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nWow! Wow! Wow! \nStumbled upon the little gem on my travels through Vietnam! \nAbsolutely tasty! \n\nThe coffee is so well done! \nWe got the creamy mushroom noodles and the burger and I must say, an absolute highlight. \nMy partner and I still reminisce about this little place. \n\nFriendly staff and very affordable. \n\nHighly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2024",
